                                  "text": "```diff\ndiff --git a/e2e\\README.md b/e2e\\README.md\nnew file mode 100644\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/e2e\\README.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@\n+E2E tests for NaviAI-Back (Jest)\r\n+\r\n+How to run\r\n+\r\n+1. Ensure the backend is running locally (default: http://localhost:8080). You can run the Spring Boot app with:\r\n+\r\n+```bash\r\n+cd NaviAI-Back/app\r\n+mvn spring-boot:run\r\n+```\r\n+\r\n+2. Install test deps and run tests:\r\n+\r\n+```bash\r\n+cd NaviAI-Back/e2e\r\n+npm ci\r\n+npm test\r\n+```\r\n+\r\n+Environment\r\n+- `BASE_URL`: override backend base URL (default `http://localhost:8080`)\r\n+\r\n+Notes\r\n+- Tests assume a fresh or isolated backend DB. Running tests repeatedly without DB reset may fail due to duplicates.\r\n+- Designed to run inside a CI container or local environment; adjust `BASE_URL` when running in Docker networks.\n```",
